by chr-hertel at 2026-08-22T08:36:25Z

> @chr-hertel easier is always better :) would be it be instead or additionally?

It's both with a nested syntax:
```yaml
mcp:
    servers:
        public:
            http: { path: /mcp }
            registry:
                tools: ['App\Mcp\Public\']
                resources: ['*']
        editors:
            http: { path: /mcp/editors }
            registry: '*'
        reporting:
            http: { path: /mcp/reporting }
            registry: ['App\Mcp\Reporting\']
```

